1181
00:02:29,177 --> 00:02:34,177
I Had Fun Over Summer Vacation...

1182
00:02:32,257 --> 00:02:34,167
I just love summer vacation.

1183
00:02:34,167 --> 00:02:36,807
With all this free time, I can do things I enjoy.

1184
00:02:36,807 --> 00:02:39,987
And throwing toys around is 
one of the things you enjoy?

1185
00:02:39,987 --> 00:02:41,487
Don't play around too much.

1186
00:02:41,487 --> 00:02:43,287
Remember, we have homework, as well.

1187
00:02:43,287 --> 00:02:45,667
I'll have to work the fields next!

1188
00:02:46,607 --> 00:02:47,707
Lady Catarina.

1189
00:02:48,117 --> 00:02:49,377
I baked these sweets.

1190
00:02:49,377 --> 00:02:51,127
Would you care to have some?

1191
00:02:51,127 --> 00:02:53,417
Wow, thanks!

1192
00:02:53,417 --> 00:02:56,247
I haven't had your homemade sweets in so long!

1193
00:02:57,587 --> 00:02:59,367
It's delicious!

1194
00:03:00,457 --> 00:03:04,197
Thank you for looking after Catarina at school.

1195
00:03:04,197 --> 00:03:05,747
I'm sure it's been challenging.

1196
00:03:05,927 --> 00:03:08,197
No, not at all.

1197
00:03:08,197 --> 00:03:10,357
She changed drastically

1198
00:03:10,357 --> 00:03:12,927
after she took hat bump to the head as a child.

1199
00:03:12,927 --> 00:03:14,587
She was a selfish brat before,

1200
00:03:14,587 --> 00:03:16,467
and now she's a troublemaker.

1201
00:03:16,697 --> 00:03:20,097
But many things have changed as a result.

1202
00:03:20,547 --> 00:03:24,107
For example, the head maid, 
Joana-san, and the gardener, Tom-san.

1203
00:03:24,107 --> 00:03:26,477
They never opened up to anyone before,

1204
00:03:26,637 --> 00:03:29,707
but they seem to enjoy themselves 
so much with Lady Catarina.

1205
00:03:29,967 --> 00:03:31,567
That goes for me, as well.

1206
00:03:32,727 --> 00:03:34,167
That's true.

1207
00:03:34,167 --> 00:03:35,677
It's because of her

1208
00:03:35,677 --> 00:03:39,477
Me and my husband can speak speak honestly with each other now.

1209
00:03:39,477 --> 00:03:42,627
She's made the entire Claes 
household a brighter—

1210
00:03:41,137 --> 00:03:43,677
Heave-ho!

1211
00:03:46,247 --> 00:03:49,317
She's made the entire household a bri—

1212
00:03:48,227 --> 00:03:50,037
And here we go!

1213
00:03:52,877 --> 00:03:54,377
She's made the—

1214
00:03:53,637 --> 00:03:57,297
Heave-ho and here we go!

1215
00:03:58,007 --> 00:04:00,547
Heave-ho and—

1216
00:04:00,547 --> 00:04:01,727
Catarina!

1217
00:04:01,727 --> 00:04:04,267
Stop belting out those outlandish yells!

1218
00:04:04,267 --> 00:04:07,267
Catarina Claes's

1219
00:04:04,267 --> 00:04:07,267
glamorous summer vacation

1220
00:04:04,267 --> 00:04:07,267
Part 2

1221
00:04:11,217 --> 00:04:12,777
This year's watermelons

1222
00:04:12,777 --> 00:04:14,687
were as sweet and delicious as last year's, right?

1223
00:04:14,687 --> 00:04:16,457
Yes, they were.

1224
00:04:18,347 --> 00:04:22,197
The breeze feels so nice. It's making me sleepy.

1225
00:04:22,197 --> 00:04:24,997
Please, Sister. If you fall asleep out here,

1226
00:04:24,997 --> 00:04:26,917
Mother will scold you again.

1227
00:04:26,917 --> 00:04:28,197
That's fine.

1228
00:04:28,197 --> 00:04:30,267
The grass is really comfy.

1229
00:04:30,267 --> 00:04:31,667
Why don't you try it, too?

1230
00:04:31,667 --> 00:04:32,687
I'll pass.

1231
00:04:32,687 --> 00:04:34,127
Aww...

1232
00:04:42,817 --> 00:04:44,137
Keith!

1233
00:04:44,867 --> 00:04:48,027
Come on, hurry up! Race you to that tree!

1234
00:04:48,027 --> 00:04:49,167
Wait!

1235
00:05:01,267 --> 00:05:02,287
Keith?

1236
00:05:05,397 --> 00:05:06,247
Monster...

1237
00:05:06,617 --> 00:05:07,727
Monster!

1238
00:05:07,727 --> 00:05:09,087
Just get out of here!

1239
00:05:09,177 --> 00:05:10,437
Mistress's child!

1240
00:05:10,437 --> 00:05:13,047
Why are you even here? You're a pest!

1241
00:05:13,047 --> 00:05:15,287
Go away already!

1242
00:05:15,787 --> 00:05:16,807
Keith?

1243
00:05:16,137 --> 00:05:18,117
Just disappear!

1244
00:05:20,047 --> 00:05:21,927
What's wrong, Keith?

1245
00:05:21,927 --> 00:05:23,067
Are you okay?

1246
00:05:24,737 --> 00:05:27,817
Yeah... I just had a scary dream.

1247
00:05:27,817 --> 00:05:31,027
Oh... You were moaning a lot.

1248
00:05:31,027 --> 00:05:32,617
Sorry for worrying you.

1249
00:05:35,507 --> 00:05:37,387
It's okay, Keith.

1250
00:05:37,387 --> 00:05:40,907
If you have any more scary dreams, I'll wake you up!

1251
00:05:42,487 --> 00:05:43,327
Okay.

1252
00:05:48,067 --> 00:05:51,177
<i>I never had any more nightmares after that.</i>

1253
00:05:51,847 --> 00:05:54,377
<i>All because she was there for me.</i>

1254
00:06:10,777 --> 00:06:12,317
I want some agar jelly noodles.

1255
00:06:12,317 --> 00:06:13,317
Huh?

1256
00:06:13,317 --> 00:06:14,597
Wh-What does that mean?

1257
00:06:14,597 --> 00:06:16,807
Agar jelly noodles are the best in summer!

1258
00:06:16,807 --> 00:06:19,837
Or... don't you have them in this world?

1259
00:06:19,837 --> 00:06:22,527
You're saying stuff that 
makes no sense again...

1260
00:06:22,527 --> 00:06:25,537
Catarina Claes's

1261
00:06:22,527 --> 00:06:25,537
glamorous summer vacation

1262
00:06:22,527 --> 00:06:25,537
