It's another hot day...

1264
00:06:33,177 --> 00:06:34,347
Hi, Catarina.

1265
00:06:35,107 --> 00:06:36,927
Geordo-sama.

1266
00:06:36,927 --> 00:06:39,417
Would you like to go cool off at the lake?

1267
00:06:44,907 --> 00:06:47,747
It sure has been hot every day, hasn't it?

1268
00:06:47,747 --> 00:06:49,627
It sure has.

1269
00:06:49,627 --> 00:06:52,267
<i>He's sitting awfully close to 
be complaining about the heat...</i>

1270
00:06:54,787 --> 00:06:56,647
Why did we stop?

1271
00:06:56,647 --> 00:06:57,887


1272
00:06:56,647 --> 00:06:56,767
Sorry!

1273
00:06:56,767 --> 00:06:56,827
Sorry!

1274
00:06:56,827 --> 00:06:56,857
Sorry!

1275
00:06:56,857 --> 00:06:56,887
Sorry!

1276
00:06:56,887 --> 00:06:57,647
Sorry!

1277
00:06:57,647 --> 00:06:57,647


1278
00:06:57,647 --> 00:06:58,907
Keith?!

1279
00:07:00,167 --> 00:07:01,397
Sister, are you okay?

1280
00:07:01,437 --> 00:07:02,947
What do you mean?

1281
00:07:02,947 --> 00:07:06,367
I'm just going to the lake with Geordo-sama, that's all.

1282
00:07:06,367 --> 00:07:07,607
"That's all"?

1283
00:07:07,607 --> 00:07:09,637
That's exactly why you're in danger!

1284
00:07:09,637 --> 00:07:12,497
Weren't you going to a big social event today?

1285
00:07:13,017 --> 00:07:16,257
I did, and I saw Alan-sama there...

1286
00:07:16,577 --> 00:07:18,617
Geordo went out by himself.

1287
00:07:19,847 --> 00:07:21,807
That's why you came after us?

1288
00:07:21,807 --> 00:07:23,067
Yes.

1289
00:07:23,787 --> 00:07:25,017
<i>So that's why!</i>

1290
00:07:25,017 --> 00:07:29,037
<i>You wanted to come along with us, didn't you?</i>

1291
00:07:29,217 --> 00:07:33,497
<i>Oh, gosh! He was lonely because we left him behind!</i>

1292
00:07:33,557 --> 00:07:37,497
<i>I thought he'd grown up a lot, 
but I guess he's still a child.</i>

1293
00:07:37,497 --> 00:07:41,347
Okay, Keith. Why don't you come with us?

1294
00:07:41,347 --> 00:07:42,137
Huh?!

1295
00:07:44,577 --> 00:07:48,757
Your tenacity <i>really</i> never ceases to amaze me, Keith.

1296
00:07:48,757 --> 00:07:50,677
Oh please, it's nothing that special.

1297
00:07:51,477 --> 00:07:53,257
<i>They're such good friends.</i>

1298
00:07:53,527 --> 00:07:55,047
Oh, I know!

1299
00:07:55,047 --> 00:07:56,447
Since we're all here...

1300
00:08:00,997 --> 00:08:02,547
It's beautiful!

1301
00:08:02,547 --> 00:08:05,707
Yes, it would be the perfect 
place for a date, but...

1302
00:08:05,707 --> 00:08:06,157
Yes, it would be the perfect 
place for a date, but...

1303
00:08:05,707 --> 00:08:06,157
I wasn't expecting this 
many people to be here...

1304
00:08:05,747 --> 00:08:06,157


1305
00:08:06,157 --> 00:08:09,187
I wasn't expecting this 
many people to be here...

1306
00:08:09,187 --> 00:08:12,677
I thought it would be even 
more fun to invite everyone!

1307
00:08:12,767 --> 00:08:15,547
I'm so happy you invited me.

1308
00:08:15,547 --> 00:08:18,137
I almost fell a step behind.

1309
00:08:18,227 --> 00:08:21,937
I'm happy for a chance to go 
on an excursion with you, too.

1310
00:08:21,937 --> 00:08:23,497
Yes, truly.

1311
00:08:23,497 --> 00:08:25,987
Thank you for bringing me along.

1312
00:08:29,367 --> 00:08:31,087
There are boats!

1313
00:08:31,087 --> 00:08:33,047
Why don't we ride one together?

1314
00:08:33,047 --> 00:08:33,767
Okay!

1315
00:08:33,767 --> 00:08:36,027
We don't want anything 
happening to you, Sister.

1316
00:08:36,027 --> 00:08:37,407
I'll ride with you, too.

1317
00:08:37,877 --> 00:08:38,827
I'm afraid we can't do that.

1318
00:08:38,827 --> 00:08:40,517
The boat can't carry that many.

1319
00:08:40,517 --> 00:08:40,577
The boat can't carry that many.

1320
00:08:40,517 --> 00:08:40,737
Catarina-sama, please ride with me!

1321
00:08:40,517 --> 00:08:43,827


1322
00:08:40,737 --> 00:08:43,577
Catarina-sama, please ride with me!

1323
00:08:43,827 --> 00:08:45,937
It'll be best with two girls!

1324
00:08:46,077 --> 00:08:48,597
In that case, I want to ride with you, too!

1325
00:08:48,597 --> 00:08:49,607
Me, too!

1326
00:08:49,987 --> 00:08:52,197
I believe you're all forgetting

1327
00:08:52,197 --> 00:08:54,327
Catarina is engaged to <i>me</i>.

1328
00:08:54,327 --> 00:08:54,667
Yes, <i>for now</i>.

1329
00:08:54,667 --> 00:08:56,707
Yes, <i>for now</i>.

1330
00:08:56,707 --> 00:08:56,707


1331
00:08:56,707 --> 00:08:58,467
And what might that mean?

1332
00:08:58,467 --> 00:08:59,267
Oh, nothing.

1333
00:08:59,387 --> 00:09:01,367
What are they arguing about?

1334
00:09:01,367 --> 00:09:03,577
Yeah, I have no idea, either.

1335
00:09:03,577 --> 00:09:06,337
Is riding in a boat really that fun?

1336
00:09:06,337 --> 00:09:07,177
Huh?

1337
00:09:07,627 --> 00:09:09,687
You don't know how much fun boats are?

1338
00:09:09,687 --> 00:09:12,007
I see you're still a child, Alan-sama.

1339
00:09:12,007 --> 00:09:13,117
Wh-What?!

1340
00:09:13,487 --> 00:09:16,627
We'll have a race to see who can row the fastest!

1341
00:09:16,627 --> 00:09:18,867
Victory will depend on arm strength,

1342
00:09:18,867 --> 00:09:20,747
so I have a good feeling about this!

1343
00:09:20,867 --> 00:09:23,867
In that case, I'd say I have a better chance of winning!

1344
00:09:23,867 --> 00:09:26,577
Then why don't we have a showdown, like we used to?

1345
00:09:26,577 --> 00:09:29,087
If that's a challenge, I accept!

1346
00:09:35,717 --> 00:09:37,727
I've never ridden in a boat before.

1347
00:09:37,727 --> 00:09:40,177
Oh, look! There are fish!

1348
00:09:43,827 --> 00:09:45,527
How did this happen?

1349
00:09:45,527 --> 00:09:46,907
Because we drew lots.

1350
00:09:46,907 --> 00:09:48,737
There's no changing the results now.

1351
00:09:51,777 --> 00:09:53,907
You're good, for someone 
who's never done this before.

1352
00:09:54,027 --> 00:09:55,387
You think so?

1353
00:09:55,387 --> 00:09:57,647
Well, I can't let her beat me.

1354
00:10:00,627 --> 00:10:02,827
See you at the finish, Alan-sama!

1355
00:10:02,827 --> 00:10:07,057
Incredible, Catarina-sama! You're amazing!

1356
00:10:13,797 --> 00:10:15,767
Delicious!

1357
00:10:15,767 --> 00:10:19,607
You really are good at making sweets, Maria-san.

1358
00:10:19,607 --> 00:10:21,117
Thank you.

1359
00:10:21,497 --> 00:10:24,847
I'm so glad we were all able to get together.

1360
00:10:24,847 --> 00:10:27,367
This'll be a fantastic summer vacation memory!

1361
00:10:27,367 --> 00:10:30,597
Yes. I think my brother is 
having a great time, too.

1362
00:10:33,537 --> 00:10:35,337
I can't really see it...

1363
00:10:35,337 --> 00:10:38,917
Look closer. He's smiling 
just a tiny bit, see?

1364
00:10:44,627 --> 00:10:46,747
<i>I can't see it at all...</i>

1365
00:10:52,587 --> 00:10:53,427
Hey!

1366
00:10:54,587 --> 00:10:56,347
Give that back!

1367
00:10:56,347 --> 00:10:57,547
You won't get away!

1368
00:10:57,547 --> 00:10:59,437
S-Sister, your skirt!

1369
00:10:59,437 --> 00:11:01,837
Worry a little more about who's watching you!

1370
00:10:59,757 --> 00:11:01,357
Get back here!

1371
00:11:02,947 --> 00:11:04,767
Honestly, that Catarina...

1372
00:11:05,957 --> 00:11:08,787
You never used to smile like that.

1373
00:11:09,257 --> 00:11:10,567
Is that so?

1374
00:11:10,567 --> 00:11:11,377
Yeah.

1375
00:11:11,737 --> 00:11:13,297
Even when you smiled on the outside,

1376
00:11:13,297 --> 00:11:15,667
you still looked bored.

1377
00:11:16,027 --> 00:11:17,917
You might be right.

1378
00:11:17,917 --> 00:11:20,447
But isn't the same true for you, Nicol?

1379
00:11:21,577 --> 00:11:25,057
You only smile when you're around her.

1380
00:11:25,537 --> 00:11:27,327
That's not...

1381
00:11:27,537 --> 00:11:29,587
Hold it!

1382
00:11:40,277 --> 00:11:43,707
Honestly, she's always leaving herself defenseless...

1383
00:11:43,707 --> 00:11:47,977
Keith, just what have they been 
teaching her at the Claes home?

1384
00:11:47,977 --> 00:11:52,317
I thought she was being taught proper 
manners, like everyone else...

1385
00:11:54,987 --> 00:11:57,987
Catarina Claes's

1386
00:11:54,987 --> 00:11:57,987
glamorous summer vacation

1387
00:11:54,987 --> 00:11:57,987
Part 4

1388
00:11:58,287 --> 00:12:00,287
Sister, you're going out?

1389
00:12:00,577 --> 00:12:03,467
Yes, I'm going shopping with Sophia.

1390
00:12:03,467 --> 00:12:07,627
She said the latest book in the 
<i>Devilish Count</i> series is out.

1391
00:12:07,627 --> 00:12:07,777
For crying out loud!

1392
00:12:07,767 --> 00:12:08,897


1393
00:12:07,777 --> 00:12:08,897
For crying out loud!

1394
00:12:08,897 --> 00:12:12,427
We've done nothing but play around 
since summer vacation started!

1395
00:12:12,427 --> 00:12:16,667
Our break should be spent formulating 
a strategy to avoid our doom!

1396
00:12:16,667 --> 00:12:18,597
Don't you all agree with me?!

1397
00:12:20,737 --> 00:12:22,917
Wh-What are you all doing?!

1398
00:12:22,917 --> 00:12:27,267
It's summer vacation, so our internal 
meetings are on break, too.

1399
00:12:27,267 --> 00:12:29,587
I-If we're going to end up doomed anyway,

1400
00:12:29,587 --> 00:12:32,927
it might be a good idea to enjoy 
this brief respite while we have it.

1401
00:12:33,077 --> 00:12:35,617
Yeah, we need a break every now and then.

1402
00:12:35,617 --> 00:12:36,757
No objections.

1403
00:12:36,757 --> 00:12:37,957
You, too, Chairman?!

1404
00:12:43,587 --> 00:12:45,127
Wh-Who are you?

1405
00:12:47,597 --> 00:12:51,457
Come and enjoy this vacation with me.

1406
00:12:52,057 --> 00:12:54,257
O-Okay!

1407
00:12:59,157 --> 00:13:03,057
My favorite bookstore is just ahead.

1408
00:13:03,307 --> 00:13:05,087
I can't wait.

1409
00:13:07,827 --> 00:13:09,667
<i>Everyone's looking at us.</i>

1410
00:13:09,977 --> 00:13:13,087
<i>These beautiful siblings stand out 
everywhere they go, don't they?</i>

1411
00:13:13,927 --> 00:13:16,357
Hey, I wonder what that shop is.

1412
00:13:16,687 --> 00:13:18,097
Want to drop in and see?

1413
00:13:18,097 --> 00:13:18,897
Sure!

1414
00:13:22,247 --> 00:13:24,847
I bet this would look great on you.

1415
00:13:25,457 --> 00:13:28,977
And I think this would look lovely on you.

1416
00:13:28,977 --> 00:13:29,707
Really?

1417
00:13:47,047 --> 00:13:50,017
Wow! Look at all the romance novels!

1418
00:13:50,017 --> 00:13:52,697
There are so many that I haven't heard of.

1419
00:13:52,697 --> 00:13:55,967
"A Love Story of a Prince and the 
Prince of an Enemy Nation"...

1420
00:13:55,967 --> 00:13:57,617
This sounds interesting!

1421
00:13:57,617 --> 00:13:59,777
Sounds like it runs pretty deep.

1422
00:13:59,977 --> 00:14:01,787
Oh, there it is!

1423
00:14:01,787 --> 00:14:04,207
The latest book in the <i>Devilish Count</i> series!

1424
00:14:04,207 --> 00:14:05,377
Oh, you're right!

1425
00:14:06,727 --> 00:14:08,087
I can't wait to read it!

1426
00:14:08,087 --> 00:14:09,567
Isn't it wonderful?

1427
00:14:08,817 --> 00:14:09,567
Yes.

1428
00:14:15,627 --> 00:14:17,997
Today was so much fun!

1429
00:14:18,057 --> 00:14:19,207
It was.

1430
00:14:19,457 --> 00:14:24,697
Somehow, I feel as if I spent time 
with you like this before, long ago.

1431
00:14:24,697 --> 00:14:28,347
Huh? But I don't think we've 
ever gone shopping together.

1432
00:14:28,407 --> 00:14:29,847
Yes, you're right.

1433
00:14:29,847 --> 00:14:32,207
I'm sure it was something I just saw in a dream.

1434
00:14:32,207 --> 00:14:33,367
Oh, that's right!

1435
00:14:33,567 --> 00:14:36,267
There's something I forgot to buy.

1436
00:14:36,267 --> 00:14:38,007
I'm going to go back and get it.

1437
00:14:38,007 --> 00:14:40,167
Oh, then I'll go with you.

1438
00:14:40,167 --> 00:14:44,087
No, that's all right. I'll have the servant go with me.

1439
00:14:44,087 --> 00:14:48,067
You can just wait here with my brother!

1440
00:14:48,427 --> 00:14:50,537
Brother! Please do your best!

1441
00:14:50,537 --> 00:14:51,327
Bye, now!

1442
00:14:51,327 --> 00:14:53,177
W-Wait... Sophia!

1443
00:14:54,207 --> 00:14:55,787
There she goes.

1444
00:14:55,787 --> 00:14:56,917
Indeed.

1445
00:14:57,227 --> 00:14:58,837
Thank you for doing this today.

1446
00:14:58,837 --> 00:14:59,697
Huh?

1447
00:14:59,697 --> 00:15:02,837
I've never seen Sophia look 
so happy while out in town.

1448
00:15:03,177 --> 00:15:04,077
Oh, not at all

1449
00:15:04,077 --> 00:15:06,477
I had a wonderful time myself.

1450
00:15:06,477 --> 00:15:07,867
Catarina Claes...

1451
00:15:09,027 --> 00:15:14,537
My sister and I are both 
truly happy to have met you.

1452
00:15:14,537 --> 00:15:16,847
U-Um... Nicol-sama?

1453
00:15:22,237 --> 00:15:24,707
I know I can't wish for it to last forever,

1454
00:15:25,717 --> 00:15:27,367
so for just this instant...

1455
00:15:29,587 --> 00:15:31,457
Let me stay by your side.

1456
00:15:31,607 --> 00:15:34,207
What?!

1457
00:15:36,217 --> 00:15:37,957
I'm back!

1458
00:15:37,957 --> 00:15:39,887
Wh-What happened?!

1459
00:15:39,887 --> 00:15:41,747
The Devilish Count...

1460
00:15:41,747 --> 00:15:42,387
Huh?!

1461
00:15:44,587 --> 00:15:48,387
<i>Come to think of it, Nicol did 
say there was someone he liked.</i>

1462
00:15:48,987 --> 00:15:53,027
<i>There's no one alive who wouldn't 
fall for that kind of charm.</i>

1463
00:15:53,557 --> 00:15:56,557
Catarina Claes's

1464
00:15:53,557 --> 00:15:56,557
glamorous summer vacation

1465
00:15:53,557 --> 00:15:56,557
Part 5

1466
00:16:03,457 --> 00:16:06,017
There are a lot of women here today.

1467
00:16:06,017 --> 00:16:08,607
Alan-sama is going to be performing.

1468
00:16:08,607 --> 00:16:10,487
Ah, So that's why...

1469
00:16:10,487 --> 00:16:11,707
Good evening.

1470
00:16:12,217 --> 00:16:14,127
I see you're all here, too.

1471
00:16:14,347 --> 00:16:16,387
Good evening, President.

1472
00:16:16,387 --> 00:16:19,507
It's nice to see you during our break!

1473
00:16:19,657 --> 00:16:22,417
I'm happy to hear you say that.

1474
00:17:19,947 --> 00:17:21,657
These are for you, Alan-sama.

1475
00:17:21,657 --> 00:17:23,807
That was a wonderful performance.

1476
00:17:23,977 --> 00:17:26,397
Oh... Thanks.

1477
00:17:26,397 --> 00:17:29,277
That last song was one I hadn't heard before.

1478
00:17:30,497 --> 00:17:33,827
Yeah... This was my first time performing that one.

1479
00:17:34,217 --> 00:17:36,407
It's called "For You, My Dearest One."

1480
00:17:36,547 --> 00:17:40,547
Oh... So you played it with the person you love in mind?

1481
00:17:41,667 --> 00:17:44,677
W-Well, yeah, maybe...

1482
00:17:44,677 --> 00:17:47,127
But it's not that I love her, exactly...

1483
00:17:47,687 --> 00:17:49,097
<i>That reaction...</i>

1484
00:17:49,097 --> 00:17:51,847
<i>He definitely had a special someone in mind.</i>

1485
00:17:52,117 --> 00:17:54,107
<i>Is it Mary?</i>

1486
00:17:54,107 --> 00:17:55,507
<i>Or perhaps Maria?</i>

1487
00:17:55,777 --> 00:17:59,917
Alan-sama, the ladies are 
waiting for you over there.

1488
00:17:59,917 --> 00:18:02,947
Shouldn't you go and see them now?

1489
00:18:02,947 --> 00:18:05,107
R-Right... I guess so.

1490
00:18:05,617 --> 00:18:09,667
<i>I guess she doesn't like seeing her 
fiancé getting so much attention...</i>

1491
00:18:11,517 --> 00:18:13,577
<i>Why does she look so serious?!</i>

1492
00:18:13,577 --> 00:18:14,887
This is dangerous.

1493
00:18:14,887 --> 00:18:18,067
I've spent all these years trying 
not to let him realize it...

1494
00:18:18,067 --> 00:18:20,447
I'll have to sow some 
doubt in him again later.

1495
00:18:20,857 --> 00:18:23,337
I can't afford any more competition!

1496
00:18:23,817 --> 00:18:28,627
<i>I thought Mary didn't like Alan 
that much, unlike in the game,</i>

1497
00:18:28,627 --> 00:18:32,757
<i>but maybe her brusque attitude toward 
him is just the other side of her love.</i>

1498
00:18:33,097 --> 00:18:37,397
<i>I really hope the one Alan 
loves is Mary, not Maria!</i>

1499
00:18:40,377 --> 00:18:43,297
I've missed being able to see you, Sirius-sama.

1500
00:18:43,297 --> 00:18:44,547
Me, too.

1501
00:18:44,547 --> 00:18:47,097
I wish summer vacation would end sooner.

1502
00:18:48,107 --> 00:18:49,617
Um, excuse me for a moment.

1503
00:18:50,617 --> 00:18:51,727
Catarina-san!

1504
00:18:53,217 --> 00:18:55,147
You're very popular, President!

1505
00:18:55,147 --> 00:18:56,327
Oh... Thanks.

1506
00:18:57,407 --> 00:18:59,127
Come to think of it,

1507
00:18:59,127 --> 00:19:01,777
you aren't engaged yet, are you?

1508
00:19:02,627 --> 00:19:04,047
Well, no.

1509
00:19:04,047 --> 00:19:05,227
There have been offers,

1510
00:19:05,227 --> 00:19:07,127
but I can't seem to settle on anyone.

1511
00:19:07,497 --> 00:19:11,107
Is there already someone you're interested in?

1512
00:19:11,107 --> 00:19:12,297
Someone I'm interested in?

1513
00:19:15,327 --> 00:19:18,227
<i>Crap! Was it rude to ask him that?!</i>

1514
00:19:18,227 --> 00:19:19,487
I-I mean...

1515
00:19:19,487 --> 00:19:20,427
No.

1516
00:19:20,427 --> 00:19:21,057
Huh?

1517
00:19:21,627 --> 00:19:24,847
No, there's no one I'm interested in.

1518
00:19:28,667 --> 00:19:31,317
Oh, the dance is about to start.

1519
00:19:31,317 --> 00:19:33,987
Your partner is waiting over there, Catarina-san.

1520
00:19:33,987 --> 00:19:37,287
R-Right! If you'll excuse me, then...

1521
00:19:41,627 --> 00:19:43,787
May I have this dance, Catarina?

1522
00:19:43,787 --> 00:19:45,057
Y-Yes.

1523
00:19:45,337 --> 00:19:47,537
Let's dance, too, Alan-sama.

1524
00:19:47,537 --> 00:19:48,877
R-Right...

1525
00:19:55,847 --> 00:19:58,847
Catarina Claes's

1526
00:19:55,847 --> 00:19:58,847
glamorous summer vacation

1527
00:19:55,847 --> 00:19:58,847
Part 6

1528
00:19:58,847 --> 00:20:00,557
Help me, Keith!

1529
00:20:00,847 --> 00:20:03,777
I haven't finished this homework 
assignment! This one, either!

1530
00:20:04,557 --> 00:20:06,727
