you were working on it!

1532
00:20:10,367 --> 00:20:12,567
W-Well, I did do a little bit of it!

1533
00:20:12,567 --> 00:20:16,387
You mean these two measly lines 
you wrote on this one page?!

1534
00:20:18,117 --> 00:20:19,497
I'm sorry.

1535
00:20:19,697 --> 00:20:24,227
It's partially my fault, too, 
for believing you without question.

1536
00:20:24,227 --> 00:20:26,007
Ouch, little brother...

1537
00:20:26,057 --> 00:20:27,367
Anyway...

1538
00:20:27,367 --> 00:20:29,637
We have to go back to school tomorrow,

1539
00:20:29,637 --> 00:20:31,607
so you need to get this taken care of today.

1540
00:20:32,077 --> 00:20:33,437
I'll help you.

1541
00:20:33,437 --> 00:20:34,337
Right...

1542
00:20:39,097 --> 00:20:41,257
Sister, I've finished this one.

1543
00:20:41,257 --> 00:20:43,047
Thanks, Keith!

1544
00:20:43,047 --> 00:20:44,437
I'm almost done, too.

1545
00:20:44,747 --> 00:20:45,747
Need help?

1546
00:20:45,747 --> 00:20:47,697
I'll be fine. You can go to bed.

1547
00:20:47,697 --> 00:20:48,597
But...

1548
00:20:48,597 --> 00:20:49,647
Really, it's fine!

1549
00:20:50,957 --> 00:20:53,417
All right. Good luck, then.

1550
00:20:53,417 --> 00:20:54,117
Sure.

1551
00:20:57,697 --> 00:21:02,377
<i>I always did my summer homework on the last 
day of break in my previous life, too...</i>

1552
00:21:02,947 --> 00:21:03,377
How's it going with <i>Fortune Lover</i>?

1553
00:21:03,377 --> 00:21:04,587
How's it going with <i>Fortune Lover</i>?

1554
00:21:03,437 --> 00:21:03,607


1555
00:21:04,587 --> 00:21:05,467
