1556
00:21:11,497 --> 00:21:15,607
Uh... I conquered the cocky 
prince and the frivolous guy,

1557
00:21:15,607 --> 00:21:18,387
but the black-hearted, sadistic prince is pretty tough.

1558
00:21:19,137 --> 00:21:21,807
Catarina just keeps getting in the way.

1559
00:21:21,807 --> 00:21:24,257
I've already completed all the routes!

1560
00:21:24,257 --> 00:21:25,637
What? Already?

1561
00:21:25,637 --> 00:21:28,167
You're so quick, Acchan...

1562
00:21:28,167 --> 00:21:30,767
There's one route that was really hard, though.

1563
00:21:30,767 --> 00:21:31,447
Wanna know which one?

1564
