1565
00:21:33,797 --> 00:21:35,017
It was...

1566
00:21:35,237 --> 00:21:38,307
Lady Catarina, it's morning. 
You need to wake up.

1567
00:21:35,717 --> 00:21:38,297
No... I don't wanna hear it...

1568
00:21:38,297 --> 00:21:41,957
I don't wanna hear it, I said! No!

1569
00:21:38,307 --> 00:21:39,627
Lady Catarina...

1570
00:21:40,187 --> 00:21:41,737
Lady Catarina!

1571
00:21:43,367 --> 00:21:46,127
